{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bf8d6232-6d5f-87d7-9c61-6ffa4ce2705d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T17:51:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good evening. Um, I am calling on the storm line, because I know City Hall is closed now, yes? It is almost six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, City Hall closes at the end of the afternoon, but this line is open for storm issues. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. My name is Anabela Duarte. I am calling for my mother, she lives, um, [line breaks up] the street, it is not plowed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. Your mother's street hasn't been plowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Not plowed since the storm. The one from last weekend, the snow and then the rain, Sunday into Monday. Now it is Tuesday and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is twenty-two Malbone Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-two Malbone Road. Got it. And when you say not plowed, is it not touched at all, or was it done once and then froze up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not touched, I think. There is the snow, and then the rain made it heavy, and now it is like, um, hard. The cars cannot go good. [inaudible] she cannot get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I missed that last part, the line's scratchy. She can't get out of the driveway, or the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street. The driveway is okay, my brother-in-law is there, he is in the garage working on a motorcycle, so he did some shoveling. But the street, no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, that's helpful. So the driveway's cleared, but the street itself is packed and icy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Packed. Like you say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll log it right now as an unplowed street, twenty-two Malbone Road, reported Tuesday evening. It goes to the crew supervisors in the morning, and they sort the routes from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:49:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. You can write it, please, so it is in the paper, yes? That we called."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's in the log with today's date and time. Do you want me to put a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four, zero, one, five, five, five, zero, one, nine, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four. Is that your cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my cell. Anabela. Sometimes the signal is not good, so if it cuts, they call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I'll note that. And Anabela, is it a dead end or a through street, do you know? It helps the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, [pause] it goes through. I think it goes to the other street, yes, through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I'll put through street. Anything else on it? Any car stuck, or does anyone need to get out for medical reasons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing like that. Only she needs to go out tomorrow, maybe, and I want the street to be okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's logged, and the crews will be working through tomorrow, so I'd expect somebody by then or the day after. If it gets worse, call this line back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:51:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you very much, Denise. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and tell your mom hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:51:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:51:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good night."
    }
  ],
